# Android signing config for the demo build.
#
# Copy this file to `key.properties` (gitignored) to choose the keystore the
# Android build is signed with. If it is absent, the build falls back to the
# default debug keystore.
#
# IMPORTANT: KRDPASS validates the CALLING app's signing certificate. This app must
# be signed with a keystore whose SHA-256 fingerprint is registered against the
# client, or sign-in fails with `invalid_client`, even when clientId, redirectUri,
# and scopes are all correct. The default Android debug keystore is NOT registered.
#
# Point these at a keystore whose fingerprint is registered for your client.
# Demo-team members receive the shared registered keystore and its credentials
# together; scripts/sync-secrets.sh writes this file for them automatically.

storeFile=/absolute/path/to/your-registered.keystore
storePassword=your-store-password
keyAlias=your-key-alias
keyPassword=your-key-password
